Description: Raspberry Pi Timelapse Controller
 Web application for creating timelapse videos with the Raspberry Pi camera.
 .
 Features include:
  - Web-based control interface with three-tab layout
  - Automatic video generation with FFmpeg or OpenCV
  - Scheduled daily video creation
  - Multiple video formats and resolutions (1080p, 720p, 480p)
  - Real-time media gallery with auto-refresh
  - Camera orientation controls (horizontal/vertical flip)
  - Production deployment with Apache and mod_wsgi
 .
 The web interface is available at http://localhost/timelapse after installation.
 .
 Service management:
  systemctl status apache2 - Check Apache status
  systemctl restart apache2 - Restart application
  tail -f /var/log/apache2/timelapse_error.log - View logs
